OL,8,     FOrchestra in Stravinsky's
OL,9,     Fconcerto. Also performed are Helix
OL,10,     Fby Esa-Pekka Salonen and
OL,11,     FTchaikovsky's Fourth Symphony.
OL,12,G0630 Breakfast
OL,13,     FAl Ryan presents Radio 3's
OL,14,     FBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,15,     Femail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
